            "value": "Ibiguzi n'amafaranga asigaye byiyuzuza ubwabyo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fees came to %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibiguzi byose hamwe byageze kuri %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Find a name, number, merchant code, amount or reference.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shakisha izina, nimero, kode y'umucuruzi, amafaranga cyangwa nimero y'igikorwa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Flags": {},
    "Free": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ubuntu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free and open source": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni ubuntu, kandi kode yayo irafunguye"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Free, with source available": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni ubuntu, kode y'inkomoko iraboneka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Grinning": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Useka cyane"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Groceries": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibiribwa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Happy": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wishimye"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Health": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ubuzima"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hi, I'm Shima, and I made StarHash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muraho, nitwa Shima, kandi ni njye wakoze StarHash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Highlights": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iby'ingenzi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How long a payment waits first": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Igihe ubwishyu bubanza gutegereza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I built it because I was tired of how hard USSD makes paying. Typing codes and digging through menus for the things you do every day felt wrong, so StarHash does them in a few taps.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nayikoze kuko nari narambiwe ukuntu USSD igora kwishyura. Kwandika kode no gushakisha muri menu ku bintu ukora buri munsi byansaga nk'ibidakwiye, ni yo mpamvu StarHash ibikora mu gukanda gake."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I hope it makes paying a little easier. Enjoy it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nizeye ko izakorohereza kwishyura ho gato. Uyikoreshe neza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "I made it on my own, because USSD made paying harder than it should be.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nayikoze ku giti cyanjye, kuko USSD yatumaga kwishyura bigorana kurusha uko byari bikwiye."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If something is off, write to me first. I answer you myself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Niba hari ikitagenda neza, banza unyandikire. Ngusubiza ubwanjye."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you turn on the lock, iOS checks your Face ID, Touch ID or passcode. StarHash never sees your face or fingerprint; it is only told whether the check passed.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nushyiraho ifunga, iOS igenzura Face ID, Touch ID cyangwa kode y'ibanga yawe. StarHash ntijya ibona isura yawe cyangwa igikumwe cyawe; ibwirwa gusa niba igenzura ryagenze neza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Import data": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Injiza amakuru"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Imported": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Byinjijwe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Settings you can stop StarHash saving transactions, using contacts, remembering recent recipients, Nearby, auto-verify and each of its notifications at any time. You can delete any transaction, or erase everything with Delete All Data. Deleting the app removes it all too.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mu Igenamiterere, igihe icyo ari cyo cyose ushobora kubuza StarHash kubika ibikorwa, gukoresha abo muvugana no kwibuka abo wishyuye vuba, ndetse ukazimya Hafi aha, Kugenzura byikora na buri menyesha yayo. Ushobora gusiba igikorwa icyo ari cyo cyose, cyangwa ugasiba byose ukoresheje Siba amakuru yose. Gusiba porogaramu na byo bikuraho byose."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Shortcuts, check **StarHash SMS** was added under that name.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muri Shortcuts, reba ko **StarHash SMS** yongeweho kuri iryo zina."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In Shortcuts, tap **Add Shortcut**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Muri Shortcuts, kanda **Add Shortcut**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In love": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wakunze"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It comes straight back here. Nothing is saved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bihita bigaruka hano. Nta kibikwa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It goes in your own QR code, so friends\nscan it to pay you. It stays on your iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ijya muri kode yawe ya QR, kugira ngo inshuti zawe\nziyisikane zikwishyure. Iguma kuri iPhone yawe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is removed from Buy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ikurwa muri Gura."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It is removed from StarHash only.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gisibwa muri StarHash gusa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "It's free, its source code is public, and it's private: no account, no server, no tracking. Everything stays on your iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni ubuntu, kode yayo iri ahagaragara, kandi irinda ibanga ryawe: nta kwiyandikisha, nta seriveri, nta gukurikiranwa. Byose biguma kuri iPhone yawe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep On": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bigumeho"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Keep a history of what you pay and receive": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bika amateka y'ibyo wishyura n'ibyo wakira"
