    },
    "StarHash SMS": {},
    "StarHash cannot read your SMS. If you set up auto-verify, your own Shortcuts automation passes messages containing RWF to StarHash, which reads them on your iPhone to confirm payments. Messages that are not MTN MoMo or Airtel Money transactions are ignored and not kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ntishobora gusoma SMS zawe. Niba utunganyije Kugenzura byikora, automation yawe bwite ya Shortcuts yoherereza StarHash ubutumwa burimo RWF, nayo ikabusomera kuri iPhone yawe kugira ngo yemeze ubwishyu. Ubutumwa butari ubw'ibikorwa bya MTN MoMo cyangwa Airtel Money burirengagizwa kandi ntibubikwa."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash couldn't read it. Try saving it to your iPhone first.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ntiyabashije kuyisoma. Gerageza kubanza kuyibika kuri iPhone yawe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash has no account, no server and no tracking. What it keeps stays on your iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ntigira konti, ntigira seriveri kandi ntigukurikirana. Ibyo ibika biguma kuri iPhone yawe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is Locked": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash irafunze"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is a free app that helps you pay with MTN MoMo and Airtel Money in Rwanda: it fills in the USSD code your wallet uses and opens your iPhone's dialer. By using StarHash you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ni porogaramu y'ubuntu igufasha kwishyura ukoresheje MTN MoMo na Airtel Money mu Rwanda: yuzuza kode ya USSD konti yawe ikoresha, igafungura aho uhamagarira kuri iPhone yawe. Ukoresheje StarHash, uba wemeye aya mabwiriza. Niba utayemera, turakwinginze ntuyikoreshe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is an independent app. It is not made, endorsed or supported by MTN Group, MTN Rwanda, Airtel Africa or Airtel Rwanda. MTN, MoMo, Airtel and Airtel Money are their owners' trademarks, used only to name the services StarHash works with.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ni porogaramu yigenga. Ntiyakozwe, ntiyemejwe kandi ntishyigikiwe na MTN Group, MTN Rwanda, Airtel Africa cyangwa Airtel Rwanda. MTN, MoMo, Airtel na Airtel Money ni ibirango by'ubucuruzi bya ba nyirabyo, bikoreshwa gusa mu kuvuga serivisi StarHash ikorana na zo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is free, and its code is open for anyone to read and improve.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ni ubuntu, kandi kode yayo ifunguriye buri wese kuyisoma no kuyinoza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is free, with no account, subscription or advertising. Its source code is published under the PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, which lets you use and change the code for any non-commercial purpose.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ni ubuntu, nta konti, nta kwiyandikisha kwishyurwa, nta n'amatangazo. Kode y'inkomoko yayo yashyizwe ahagaragara hakurikijwe uruhushya rwa PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0, rukwemerera gukoresha no guhindura iyo kode ku mpamvu iyo ari yo yose itari iy'ubucuruzi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is free, with public source code, no ads, no account and nothing sent off your iPhone. There is nothing to buy.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ni ubuntu: kode y'inkomoko yayo iri ahagaragara, nta matangazo, nta konti, kandi nta kintu na kimwe kiva kuri iPhone yawe. Nta kintu cyo kugura kirimo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is meant for people old enough to have a mobile money account, and is not directed at children.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash igenewe abantu bafite imyaka ihagije yo kugira konti ya mobile money, kandi ntigenewe abana."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash is provided as it is, without warranty of any kind. As far as the law allows, its developer is not liable for any loss from using it, including a payment sent to the wrong person or for the wrong amount, a failed or delayed payment, a record that is missing or wrong, or a notification that is late, missing or wrong.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash itangwa uko iri, nta ngwate y'ubwoko ubwo ari bwo bwose. Mu rugero amategeko yemera, uwayikoze ntaryozwa igihombo icyo ari cyo cyose giturutse ku kuyikoresha, harimo ubwishyu bwoherejwe ku muntu utari we cyangwa bw'amafaranga atari yo, ubwishyu bwanze cyangwa bwatinze, inyandiko ibura cyangwa itari yo, cyangwa imenyesha ritinze, ritaje cyangwa ritari ryo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash never holds, sends or receives money. Every payment is made by your mobile money provider, after you check its details on the provider's own prompt and enter your PIN there. Check the amount and who it goes to before you confirm. A payment you confirm is between you and your provider, under its own terms and fees.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ntijya ibika, yohereza cyangwa yakira amafaranga. Buri bwishyu bukorwa n'ikigo cyawe cya mobile money, nyuma y'uko ugenzura amakuru yabwo ku idirishya ry'icyo kigo ubwacyo, ukinjiza PIN yawe aho. Genzura umubare w'amafaranga n'uwo agenewe mbere yo kwemeza. Ubwishyu wemeje ni hagati yawe n'ikigo cyawe, hakurikijwe amabwiriza n'ibiguzi byacyo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash sees only the contacts you chose. You can share more in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash ibona gusa abo muvugana wahisemo. Ushobora gusangiza abandi muri porogaramu ya Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash version %@, build %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash verisiyo %@, build %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash will stop reading your %@ messages.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "StarHash izareka gusoma ubutumwa bwawe bwa %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash's code is public on GitHub": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode ya StarHash iri ahagaragara kuri GitHub"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StarHash/places.json": {},
    "Start Using StarHash": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tangira gukoresha StarHash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Status": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uko bihagaze"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stay on top of\nyour payments": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kurikirana neza\nubwishyu bwawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Step %lld of %lld": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Intambwe ya %1$lld kuri %2$lld"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Still pending": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Biracyategerejwe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggest who you\npaid here": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibutswa uwo\nwishyuye hano"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Suggest who you paid at the place you're in": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Erekana uwo wishyuye aho uri ubu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Summaries": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Incamake"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Surprised": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Watangaye"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Jya kuri %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switches the wallet you pay from": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ihindura konti wishyuriraho"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Symbol": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ikimenyetso"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "System": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nka telefoni"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "TV": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "TV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tab bar": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umurongo w'ibice"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **+**, choose **Message**, and set **Message Contains** to **RWF**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kanda **+**, hitamo **Message**, maze ushyire **RWF** muri **Message Contains**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Add Shortcut** below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kanda **Add Shortcut** hepfo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Open Shortcuts** below and go to **Automation**.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kanda **Fungura Shortcuts** hepfo maze ujye kuri **Automation**."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap **Verify Shortcut** below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kanda **Genzura shortcut** hasi aha."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell us what StarHash should do next": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tubwire icyo StarHash ikwiye gukora ubutaha"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Terms of Service": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amabwiriza y'ikoreshwa"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is %lld%% less than %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibyo ni %lld%% munsi y'ayo wakoresheje muri %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is %lld%% more than %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni %lld%% kurusha %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is about the same as %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Bingana hafi n'ibya %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That is an %@ number; you pay with %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo ni nimero ya %@; wishyura ukoresheje %@."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That's not the right message.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ubwo si bwo butumwa bukwiye."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The USSD codes, fees and limits StarHash uses come from the providers' published information, and the providers may change them without notice. Activity is a record kept for you, from what you dial and the messages you pass to StarHash; your provider's records are the ones that count. With auto-verify on, a payment that no message confirms within an hour is marked failed; if it did go through, mark it as confirmed. StarHash's reminders and summaries are worked out from that record, and iOS decides when they show: a reminder that is late or never comes says nothing about whether a payment went through.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode za USSD, ibiguzi n'imipaka StarHash ikoresha bikomoka ku makuru ibigo bitanga serivisi byatangaje, kandi ibyo bigo bishobora kubihindura nta nteguza. Ibikorwa ni inyandiko ikubikiwe, ikomoka ku byo ukanda n'ubutumwa uha StarHash; inyandiko z'ikigo cyawe ni zo zifite agaciro. Iyo Kugenzura byikora bikora, ubwishyu butemejwe n'ubutumwa ubwo ari bwo bwose mu isaha imwe bushyirwa mu byanze; niba bwarakunze, bushyire mu byemejwe. Ibyibutsa n'incamake bya StarHash bikorwa hashingiwe kuri iyo nyandiko, kandi iOS ni yo ihitamo igihe bigaragara: kwibutswa gutinze cyangwa kutaje na rimwe ntikuvuga niba ubwishyu bwaragenze neza cyangwa butagenze neza."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The codes you dial often, one tap each, up to eight pinned.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode ukunze gukanda, buri imwe ukanda rimwe gusa, ugashyira hejuru zigera ku munani."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The day it comes": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umunsi incamake iza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The first release of StarHash: pay with MTN MoMo or Airtel Money without typing USSD codes, and keep every payment in one place.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Verisiyo ya mbere ya StarHash: ishyura ukoresheje MTN MoMo cyangwa Airtel Money utanditse kode za USSD, kandi ubike ubwishyu bwose ahantu hamwe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The money goes to the number you pick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amafaranga ajya kuri nimero uhisemo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The month just ended, on the 1st": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ukwezi gushize, ku itariki ya 1"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The most went to %@, %lld%% of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icyiciro cyatwaye menshi ni %1$@, ni ukuvuga %2$lld%% yayo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The shortcut works. A message through the automation proves the rest.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shortcut irakora. Ubutumwa bunyuze muri automation ni bwo buzemeza ibisigaye."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terms for using StarHash": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amabwiriza yo gukoresha StarHash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terms for using StarHash, in plain words.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amabwiriza yo gukoresha StarHash, mu magambo yoroshye."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The text of the MoMo SMS. In an automation, pass Shortcut Input.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inyandiko ya SMS ya MoMo. Muri automation, ohereza Shortcut Input."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The wallet said it failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konti yavuze ko byanze"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These terms may change as StarHash does. The current terms are always here, with the day they took effect, and using StarHash after a change means you accept them.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aya mabwiriza ashobora guhinduka uko StarHash ihinduka. Amabwiriza agezweho ahora ari hano, hamwe n'itariki yatangiye gukurikizwa, kandi gukoresha StarHash nyuma y'impinduka bisobanura ko uyemera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This code holds no number or merchant code.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyi kode ntirimo nimero cyangwa kode y'umucuruzi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file is from a newer StarHash. Update from the App Store, then import it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyi dosiye yavuye muri StarHash nshya kuruta iyi. Vugurura StarHash kuri App Store, hanyuma wongere uyinjize."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This isn't a valid code. Use only numbers, * and #, starting with * or # and ending with #.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyi si kode yemewe. Koresha imibare, * na # gusa, utangire na * cyangwa # kandi urangize na #."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This may be a scam": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibi bishobora kuba ubutekamutwe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This year": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uyu mwaka"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Time": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isaha"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kuri"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kuri %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Igiteranyo %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Total:": {
