            "value": "Konti: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warn me about look-alike MoMo messages, and don't log them": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Mburira ku butumwa bwigana ubwa MoMo, kandi ntubwandike"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Water": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amazi"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weekly summary": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Incamake y'icyumweru"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What StarHash keeps": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibyo StarHash ibika"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What StarHash shares": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibyo StarHash isangiza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What a payment to a business was for": {},
    "What each version brought": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibyo buri verisiyo yazanye"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you sent and received in the week": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibyo wohereje n'ibyo wakiriye mu cyumweru"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's New": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibishya"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's New in StarHash": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibishya muri StarHash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What's new, the note and the source code": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibishya, ijambo ry'uwayikoze na kode y'inkomoko"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a %@ message brings money in": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo ubutumwa bwa %@ buvuga ko wakiriye amafaranga"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a %@ message confirms a payment": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo ubutumwa bwa %@ bwemeje ubwishyu"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When a payment you made is still pending": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo ubwishyu wakoze bugitegerejwe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When no %@ message confirms a payment within an hour": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo nta butumwa bwa %@ bwemeje ubwishyu mu isaha imwe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the summaries come": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Igihe incamake ziza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where StarHash opens": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aho StarHash ifungukira"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where it went": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Aho amafaranga yagiye"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which carrier do you pay with? StarHash\ndials its codes for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wishyura ukoresheje uwuhe murongo? StarHash\nigukandira kode zawo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who sent the message. In an automation, pass Shortcut Input's Sender.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Uwohereje ubutumwa. Muri automation, shyiramo Sender ya Shortcut Input."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Winking": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ukonyeza"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With your permission, StarHash reads your contacts to show who you can pay and to put names and photos on your payments. They are read on your iPhone only and never copied off it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Iyo ubyemeye, StarHash isoma abo muvugana kugira ngo ikwereke abo ushobora kwishyura, no gushyira amazina n'amafoto ku bwishyu bwawe. Basomerwa kuri iPhone yawe gusa kandi ntibigera bakopororwa ngo bayivemo."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Worn out": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Unaniwe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Write to Shima": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Andikira Shima"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writing your summary": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Turimo kwandika incamake yawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written on your iPhone by Apple Intelligence. Check the figures below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Byanditswe kuri iPhone yawe na Apple Intelligence. Genzura imibare iri hasi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Written on your iPhone by Apple Intelligence. Check the figures.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Byanditswe kuri iPhone yawe na Apple Intelligence. Genzura imibare."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wowe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You are responsible for your iPhone, its passcode and who can use it. StarHash's Face ID lock keeps Activity private, but your wallet is protected by your PIN. Never share your PIN with anyone, including someone who says they are from StarHash or your provider.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ni wowe ushinzwe iPhone yawe, kode y'ibanga yayo n'abemerewe kuyikoresha. Uburyo bwa Face ID bwo gufunga StarHash butuma Ibikorwa biguma ari ibanga, ariko konti yawe irindwa na PIN yawe. Ntukigere uha PIN yawe undi muntu uwo ari we wese, harimo n'uvuga ko aturuka kuri StarHash cyangwa ku kigo gitanga serivisi yawe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can pin up to %lld codes. Unpin one to make room.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ushobora gushyira hejuru kode zigera kuri %lld. Kura imwe hejuru kugira ngo ubone umwanya."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You paid %@ the most, %@ over %lld payments.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wishyuye %@ kurusha abandi: %@ mu bwishyu %lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You received %@ in %@ and spent nothing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wakiriye %1$@ muri %2$@ kandi nta cyo wakoresheje."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You spent %@ in %@, over %lld payments.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wakoresheje %1$@ muri %2$@, mu bwishyu %3$lld."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're all set": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Byose biteguye"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You've been using StarHash for two weeks now. Thank you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Umaze ibyumweru bibiri ukoresha StarHash. Urakoze."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your Data": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amakuru yawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your QR code": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode yawe ya QR"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your StarHash QR code": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode yawe ya QR ya StarHash"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your carrier": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sosiyete yawe y'itumanaho"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your choices": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Amahitamo yawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your codes": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Kode zawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your face: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Isura yawe: %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your iPhone and your PIN": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iPhone yawe na PIN yawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your month": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ukwezi kwawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your name": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Izina ryawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your number": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nimero yawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your number goes in your QR code, so StarHash knows where others' payments go. Nothing leaves your iPhone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nimero yawe ishyirwa muri kode yawe ya QR, kugira ngo StarHash imenye aho ubwishyu bw'abandi bujya. Nta kintu kiva kuri iPhone yawe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your transactions (who, how much, when, whether they are confirmed, and the fee, reference and balance when a message gives them), the categories you add, your recent recipients, Buy's codes and your settings. All of it is saved in StarHash's own storage on your iPhone, and none of it is sent anywhere.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibikorwa byawe (uwo, angahe, ryari, niba byemejwe, n'ikiguzi, kode y'igikorwa n'amafaranga asigaye iyo ubutumwa bubitanze), ibyiciro wongeyeho, abo wishyuye vuba, kode za Gura n'igenamiterere ryawe. Ibyo byose bibikwa mu bubiko bwa StarHash ubwayo kuri iPhone yawe, kandi nta na kimwe cyoherezwa ahandi."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your transactions (with where each was paid, when Nearby is on) and settings are part of your iPhone's own backups, to iCloud or your computer, which you control.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ibikorwa byawe (hamwe n'aho buri kimwe cyishyuriwe, iyo Hafi aha ifunguye) n'igenamiterere ryawe biri muri kopi zibikwa na iPhone yawe ubwayo, kuri iCloud cyangwa kuri mudasobwa yawe, ugenzura ubwawe."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your wallet's messages confirm each payment for you.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ubutumwa bwa konti yawe bukwemereza buri bwishyu."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your wallet's messages confirm each payment, with its fee and balance. Thank you for using StarHash.": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ubutumwa bwa konti yawe bwemeza buri bwishyu, hamwe n'ikiguzi cyabwo n'amafaranga asigaye. Urakoze gukoresha StarHash."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your wallet, your payments": {
      "localizations": {
        "rw": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Konti yawe, ubwishyu bwawe"
          }
        }
      }
    },
